# The Constant Fear of Data Loss

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/data-loss-downtime/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

Think about your customer lists, invoices, and contracts. If a server dies or someone gets hit by ransomware, that data could be gone forever. "Hoping for the optimal" isn't a backup plan. You need a setup that saves your work automatically so you never have to worry about a crash again.